
---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About Finavit Journal | Our Mission"
  description="Learn about Finavit Journal, our mission, and our approach to making nutrition and food information easier to understand."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">ABOUT FINAVIT JOURNAL</span>
    <h1>Better information.<br /><em>Healthier choices.</em></h1>
    <p>
      We believe understanding nutrition shouldn't be complicated.
      Finavit Journal makes useful information about food, vitamins,
      nutrition, and everyday wellness easier to explore.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="section-label">OUR PURPOSE</div>
    <h2>Making nutrition easier to understand.</h2>
    <p>
      Nutrition information is everywhere, but finding clear, practical,
      and reliable explanations can be difficult. Our goal is to make
      that information more accessible through straightforward articles
      supported by credible research and sources.
    </p>

    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <div class="topics">
      <article>
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Nutrition</h3>
        <p>Understand nutrients, dietary concepts, and everyday nutrition.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Vitamins</h3>
        <p>Explore vitamins, their functions, food sources, and scientific evidence.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Food</h3>
        <p>Discover the nutritional value of foods and their role in a balanced diet.</p>
      </article>
      <article>
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Wellness</h3>
        <p>Explore practical information related to everyday health and wellbeing.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <h2>Our approach</h2>
    <p>
      We aim to prioritize credible sources, explain information in
      accessible language, and distinguish established scientific
      evidence from emerging research. We also aim to review and update
      content when relevant information changes.
    </p>

    <h2>Explore Finavit</h2>
    <p>
      Finavit also offers digital tools designed to help people explore
      nutrition information, browse a food library, understand health
      insights, and interact with an AI health assistant.
    </p>
    <a class="cta" href="https://finavit.com">Explore Finavit ↗</a>

    <p class="disclaimer">
      Finavit Journal provides educational information. Its content is
      not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about-hero {
    padding: 100px 24px 85px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #f0f2e9;
  }

  .eyebrow, .section-label {
    color: #68806d;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .about-hero h1 {
    margin: 24px 0;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 72px);
    line-height: 1.12;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .about-hero h1 em {
    color: #52745a;
  }

  .about-hero p {
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: auto;
    color: #667168;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .content {
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 80px 24px;
  }

  .content h2 {
    margin: 50px 0 16px;
    font-family: 'DM Serif Display', serif;
    font-size: 32px;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .content > p {
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .topics {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }

  .topics article {
    padding: 25px;
    border: 1px solid #e5e8df;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #fdfdf9;
  }

  .topics article span {
    color: #77927a;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .topics h3 {
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .topics p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #68736a;
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .cta {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 7px;
    background: #244c38;
    color: white;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .disclaimer {
    margin-top: 55px;
    padding-top: 22px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e8df;
    font-size: 13px !important;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .about-hero {
      padding: 75px 22px;
    }

    .topics {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
